        "id": 708
      },
      "writtenOn": "2014-07-18T10:30:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This won\u0027t work for following scenario:\n\n- user connects, authenticates;\n- user changes password;\n- user connects again using old password.\n\nldappool will reuse existing connection with old credentials then. I guess there should be some guard to force password verification.",
      "revId": "03a7f1820d0972b96513ffe88f93a0eee63e6325",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
